# NaN corner: control tetrahedron plus one triangle with a NaN corner.
# The weld must drop that triangle (loudly) and remesh the tetrahedron;
# one NaN corner used to poison the mesh area and fail the whole run.
v 0 0 0
v 1 0 0
v 0 1 0
v 0 0 1
v nan 0 0
v 9 0 0
v 9 1 0
f 1 3 2
f 1 2 4
f 1 4 3
f 2 3 4
f 5 6 7
